  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec810658681aef64daf163b006389223, type: 3}
  m_Name: ExhibMan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NPCName: Peter
  lines:
  - Hello and welcome to our exhibition hall! My name is Peter and I am a virtual
    staff member here, alongside Catherine.
  - You can use our exhibition hall to showcase your products, whether it's lifestyle,
    food or electronics. The space is currently designed as a fashion showroom, but
    it can be adjusted to fit your needs.
  - My dialogue can also be customized and I can be placed anywhere inside the space
    to talk about your company and products. As virtual staff, I am around 24/7 to
    facilitate an enjoyable experience for every user.
  - Do check out the teleporters we added in to help you move around the space. I
    hope you enjoy your visit.
